   "translation_file": "tome-orcs.lua",
   "translation_line": 5861,
   "section": "tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/thoughts-of-iron.lua",
   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Melding psionics with steamtech you create 5 mind drones at your sides that fly towards your target.\n\t\tIf they encounter a creature they will latch on it and bore into its skull for 6 turns, disrupting its thoughts.\n\t\tDisrupted creatures have %d%% chances to fail to use talents and suffer a -%d%% reduction to fear and sleep immunity.",
   "target": "将灵能和蒸汽科技结合，你在身边制造 5 架精神无人机械飞向目标。\n\t\t无人机械接触到生物时，会附着其上并钻入其颅骨 6 回合，干扰思考能力。\n\t\t受影响的生物有 %d%% 几率使用技能失败，同时恐惧和睡眠免疫减少 %d%%。",
   "source_file": "/workspace/tome4-dlcs/orcs/tome-orcs/data/talents/steam/thoughts-of-iron.lua (unpinned public DLC checkout)",
